# __NAME__

Next App Router, React 19, Tailwind v4, TypeScript. Routes live in `src/app/`; shared code goes into `src/`.

## Commands

- Install: `__PACKAGE_MANAGER__ install`
- Dev: `bun run dev`
- Build: `bun run build`
- Start: `bun run start`
- Typecheck: `bun run typecheck` (typechecker `__TYPECHECKER__`)
- Lint: `bun run lint` (linter `__LINTER__`)
- Format: `bun run format` (formatter `__FORMATTER__`)

The `@/*` alias points at `src/*` without a `baseUrl`. Tabs at 4 wide, printWidth 100.
